      para('Rabbi Akiva answers him. The Gemara (28b:15–16) says his answer is <span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">חֲדָא וְעוֹד</span>, "one reason, and another." Pick both of Rabbi Akiva\'s reasons.');
      var lock = el('div', 'rounded-xl border border-[#2b3338] bg-[#11161a] p-4'); story.appendChild(lock);
